        },
        "text_ex9yPk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At COLAMY, we believe a better home starts with better choices, not more of them.That’s why we don’t build around endless options or overwhelming catalogs.We focus on a tighter collection of modern furniture — selected for comfort, function, and easy living — so customers can spend less time comparing, and more time enjoying the home they’re creating.</p>",
