        "text_ndCVB6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>COLAMY started with ergonomic seating, built around a simple belief: every home deserves a comfortable place to work, focus, and recharge.</p>",
            "content_width": 100,
            "text_size": "text-lg",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "heading_fpzrXE": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>The Evolution</strong>",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_ETF6Eb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>As our first customers grew, so did their needs. The same people who loved our office chairs started asking: ‘Can you make my dining chair this comfortable?’ We listened, and expanded our seating expertise to every corner of the home.</p>",
            "content_width": 100,
            "text_size": "text-lg",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "heading_HmQUte": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>The Vision </strong>",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_Rt3igP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Today, COLAMY stands for a<em>curated</em>approach to modern living. We’re still the seating experts, but now we’re your partners in creating a home that’s comfortable, functional, and uniquely yours — without the overwhelm.</p>",
            "content_width": 100,
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
